### **3. Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :RainyWeather ;
    :hasRoadCondition :WetRoad ;
    :hasTrafficSignal :RedLightSignal ;
    :hasObstacleRisk :PotentialObscuredPedestrian .

:RainyWeather a :WeatherCondition ;
    :reducesVisibility true ;
    :increasesStoppingDistance true .

