#### **Risk 2:**
**Description:**
The **red traffic signal** requires the vehicle to stop, but **low visibility and glare** may cause the autonomous system to **misidentify the signal** or fail to detect it in time.
**Severity Score:** **0.9** (Critical)

#### **Risk 3:**
**Description:**
**Potential pedestrians or cyclists** may be **occluded by darkness or glare**, increasing the risk of **late detection** and **collision**.
**Severity Score:** **0.8** (High)

#### **Risk 4:**
**Description:**
The **streetlight glare** may **temporarily blind** the vehicle’s sensors (cameras/LiDAR), causing **temporary loss of situational awareness**.
**Severity Score:** **0.75** (High)

#### **Risk 5:**
**Description:**
The **barrier/guardrail** on the right side may indicate a **narrow road or sharp turn**, increasing the risk of **losing control** due to **reduced traction**.
**Severity Score:** **0.7** (Moderate-High)

